Comment:
 The upstream repository root LICENSE and README.sslutils identify this work as
 PostgreSQL-licensed, and that root license is the packaging license authority
 selected by the Pigsty maintainer on 2026-09-01.
 .
 The unmodified sslutils.c file also contains an inconsistent source header
 referring to the EnterpriseDB Limited Use License and prohibiting
 redistribution. That upstream notice is deliberately preserved verbatim in
 the packaged source. This metadata records the conflict; it does not remove,
 rewrite, or conceal the notice.

